sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Your script
    participant A as aisbx
    participant X as sbx
    S->>A: aisbx up --backend ... DIR
    A->>X: sbx create with the backend and addon kits
    A-->>S: sandbox name on stdout
    S->>A: aisbx run NAME --prompt-file task.md
    A->>X: sbx exec: agent update, prompt upload
    A->>X: sbx exec: agent in print mode
    X-->>S: agent output on stdout
    A->>X: dismiss held network requests (default)
    S->>A: aisbx rm NAME
    A->>X: sbx rm --force
